WEBVTT

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.970
Fuji P's practicing hard again today.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.070
Are you okay?

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.870
Is he okay?

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.010
Thank goodness!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.190
Nagsia... You're making funny faces.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.640
Honoka! You scared me!

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.750
You just didn't realize I was here.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.310
You only had eyes for Fujimura-kun.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.170
What are you saying?

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.230
I was just watching the 
soccer team practice...

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.830
You don't have to hide it...

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.100
We're friends, aren't we?

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.630
I told you... You're wrong.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.530
I have to practice.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:54.810
See you!

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:59.040
Nagisa's always like that 
when it comes to Fuji P mipo.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:02.000
I don't know why she won't admit it.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.110
I guess there's nothing I can do.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.680
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.450
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:18.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.630
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:24.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.360
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.370
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:32.170
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:37.980
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:39.940
<i>we both</i>

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.280
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:56.160
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:02.330
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:03.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:09.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:13.410
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.480
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:20.220
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:27.380
I will now announce the results of the 
Verone Academy's singing competition...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.080
First, the award for effort...

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.460
Second year, Azusa class...

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.790
Up until now, I've never really thought about

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.710
what's most important to me...

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:42.960
What's most important is...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.250
Your own heart that treasures your

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.290
feelings for the person who's 
most important to you, and...

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.860
Being honest about what's in your heart...

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:54.260
After all, that's what you are.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.120
Being honest...?

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:05.640
But there are times when you just can't be...

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:07.950
Thank you all for waiting...

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.740
The winner is...

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.470
Second year, Sakura class.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:20.880
They will enter the year-end Seibu Regional 
Middle School Singing Competition...!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.920
We won! We did it, didn't we?

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.550
We'll have to do our best in 
the competition, won't we, Yui?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.670
Yui! I'm sorry... Are you okay?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.350
What's wrong?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:36.090
Normally, you would...

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.610
Yui!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.560
What is it, Nagisa?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.950
It's nothing.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.950
If you have a problem, you can tell me...

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.400
If you think I can help.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.750
I don't have a problem...

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.560
When you have a problem, sometimes it 
helps just to talk to someone about it.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.070
It'll make you feel better.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.030
I'll help you if I can.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.900
You'll help me?

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.670
Of course! We're friends, aren't we?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:10.870
Come to think of it, I heard that you

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.550
went to help out at a 
farm with Fujimura-san...

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.400
Is it true?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.410
Kimata-san's grandfather owns a 
farm, so we went to help out there.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.570
What about it?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.730
So you know a lot about 
Fujimura-san, don't you?

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.970
Why do you want to know?

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.980
Fujimura-san's birthday is coming up soon.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.630
I wanted to give him a present,

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.770
but I don't know what to give him.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.890
No... It can't be...!

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:41.960
I love Fujimura-san, so I...

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:51.700
"EXTREMELY SHAKEN UP! MY FEELINGS FOR FUJI P"

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:56.580
We must live eternally together with the

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.380
Power of Annihilation.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:05.600
And nothing can get away from 
the control that it has...

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:11.030
And even if I am the source of the Power 
of Annihilation, I am not an exception.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:18.000
And all of you, as a part of me, 
must understand what that means...

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:24.390
We must find the power 
of the stones before the

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.010
Power of Annihilation annihilates us.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:32.610
That way, I will be liberated 
forever from the spell of darkness.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.180
We've put all of our efforts into finding

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.810
the power of the Prism Stones, but we still

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.530
don't know where it is.

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:46.210
The only way you will live 
is by making me complete.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.160
The only one in the world 
of darkness who is suited

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.220
to having the Power of Creation is me because

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:54.670
I control the darkness.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.970
I hope you realize that.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.140
I do.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.500
It's ready.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.230
This is the last batch zakenna.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.950
Oh, no! The scones are gone!

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.920
Do you know where they went zakenna?

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.620
You ate them, didn't you zakenna?

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.870
Say something zakenna!

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:25.490
Now I'm really mad zakenna!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.380
Spit it out! Spit it out! 
Spit it out zakenna!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.920
I knew it! Give them back zakenna!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:36.800
Zakenna!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:41.650
Zakenna...

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.470
Zakenna!

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.420
Are you sure it's okay?

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:52.720
What we're doing is going 
against Jyaku-King's will.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.580
That overpowering feeling...

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:59.110
Every time I stand in front of 
Jyaku-King, my body always cringes.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.970
Don't tell me he's seen through everything...

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.640
Our goal hasn't changed.

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:07.440
We're going to get the power of 
the stones for our own sakes.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.610
Can we do it?

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.910
We can't turn back now.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.700
Don't worry...

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:19.500
Haven't you realized it yet?

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:22.510
We're no longer the same as we were before.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.530
Not what we were before?

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.360
What do you mean by that?

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:27.760
You'll find out.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.130
You'll find out. You'll find out.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:33.080
We're not what we used to be.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.230
What does it mean?

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.040
What does it mean?

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.340
What Fujimura-kun likes?

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:45.240
Nagisa told me that you and Fujimura-san 
are childhood friends, aren't you?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:49.350
As childhood friends, I thought 
you might know what he likes.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.520
Will you tell me?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.290
Let's see...

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.300
I guess it's soccer.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.420
He's loved soccer since he was 
little, and whenever he had time,

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.320
he was always kicking 
the soccer ball around.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.820
Maybe something he can use in soccer then...

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.620
Maybe a ball or shoes...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.770
That sounds expensive...

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.260
This is just my opinion, but...

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.130
If you're going to give 
him a present, he would

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.150
be happy with anything 
that comes from the heart.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.610
That's the kind of person Fujimura-kun is.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:18.310
Something from the heart, huh...?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.340
You're right.

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:20.790
Thank you, Yukishiro-san.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:22.010
Let's go, Nagisa.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:30.110
Morioka-san is going to give him a present...

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.370
That's right.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.290
And you're going to help her...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.370
It just turned out that way.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:41.230
But if a friend asks for your help,

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.070
it's only natural as a friend to help her.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.130
Nagisa!

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.560
I'll be right there.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.270
See you!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.210
It's gotten complicated mipo.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.180
Is it going to be okay?

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.550
It's only natural to help her...

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:03.390
After all, Yui is one of my precious friends.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.860
She's my friend.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.230
Where's Fujimura-san?

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:13.730
Over there.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.670
Don't tell me he's hurt?

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.480
Kimata-san!

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.270
Misumi-san...

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.660
What happened to Fuji P?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.120
He twisted his ankle.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.410
Is he okay?

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:29.970
He's fine.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:32.130
Injuries are an inevitable 
part of being a soccer player.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.660
It happens all the time.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.420
But we have a game soon.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:38.280
I hope it doesn't affect the game.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.640
I see...

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.400
See you!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.400
It's hard being a soccer player, isn't it?

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.670
I wish there was something 
that I could do for him...

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.060
An amulet...

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.870
So his injury will heal, 
and he won't get hurt

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.380
and he'll win the game.

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.880
An amulet! That's it!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.060
That's a nice idea.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:07.130
I'll make him one, and give it to him.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.190
I'd better hurry home, and make it for him.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.560
Thanks, Nagisa!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.560
You're welcome...

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:17.560
Nagisa...?

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:20.310
Are you sure about this?

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.700
Don't you really want to give 
Fujimura-kun the amulet yourself?

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.250
I can understand your feelings 
about helping out a friend, but...

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:33.260
But this isn't good...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.010
You have to be honest 
about your own feelings.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:36.980
Be brave...

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:40.490
If you deceive yourself about your feelings

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.320
and run away from it, it's only 
going to cause you pain...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.130
I know that!

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:47.010
I know, but I can't do anything about it...

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.390
That's why I'm suffering!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.160
Nagisa!

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.190
I know that!

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.900
I know, but I can't do anything about it...

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:23.900
That's why I'm suffering!

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.590
I shouldn't take it out on Honoka...

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.300
She was just worried about me.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:33.890
I'm the worst friend.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:35.540
Nagi...!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.510
Misumi-san?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.250
I thought it was you.

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.910
What are you doing here?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.020
Aren't you cold?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.050
What am I going to do?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.160
Why is he sitting next to me?

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:55.860
This...?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.200
I messed up, but it's okay...

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.030
I went to the doctor, and he said 
it's nothing to worry about.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.810
I'm so glad.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.230
Did something happen?

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:08.540
If you don't mind talking to me, I'll listen.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:12.800
Misumi-san?

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.660
It doesn't have anything to do with you.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.220
No! That's not what I wanted to say!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.220
I see...

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.340
He hates me now.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.530
Don't catch cold.

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:41.740
It's warm...

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:43.930
It's so warm!

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.230
Why am I crying?

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:53.730
Why?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.990
How can I help Nagisa?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.080
I want to help her.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:05.970
Because Nagisa...

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.270
When that happened...

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:15.180
And that time, too.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.680
Whenever I was having a hard 
time, she was right by my side.

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.250
That's why I want to...

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:33.230
It's just as I thought Pollun and 
I are totally incompatible mepo.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:34.880
It's your fault popo!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.300
Why is it my fault mepo?

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.230
Nagisa! Play with me popo!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.140
Popo! Let's play popo! Let's play popo!

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.740
Nagisa? Are you asleep popo?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.270
I'm going to sleep, too, popo.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.780
Nagisa... you're awake, aren't you mepo?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.080
What are you doing?

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.240
Are you trying to suffocate me?

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.190
I know you were just 
pretending to sleep mepo!

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:14.170
You can't fool me mepo!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:18.100
Work up your courage, and be honest mepo!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.170
You can do it mepo.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.510
Trust me. I know mepo.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.260
Mepple...

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.780
You say I can do it, but...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.220
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.760
If it's something from your 
heart, I think he'll be happy.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:42.850
My heart...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.690
Fuji P's birthday is tomorrow,

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.450
and I can't make him a present like Yui...

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.810
And probably when I'm face to face with him,

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.320
I won't be able to say what I want.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.300
But if I put my feelings 
in a letter to him...

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.210
Dear Fujimura-san...

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.250
If I put my heart into the letter I write...

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.380
Dear Fujimura-san...

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.910
Happy birthday. Good luck on 
your last middle school game.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:23.100
I'll be there to root for you.

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:26.270
Sincerely, Nagisa Misumi.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.810
It took me all night, and 
this is all I wrote...

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:31.510
But I wrote it.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.390
Nagisa! What did you write mepo?

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:36.210
You know I wouldn't tell you!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.770
I'll give it to him with the muffler.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.800
I'm leaving!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:48.520
I couldn't come up with 
any way to help Nagisa.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.580
In any case, I have to talk to her.

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.820
Nagisa! I finished the amulet.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.720
Will you look at it?

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.400
Stay with me! Don't leave!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.810
Okay, I'll stay with you.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.030
Fujimura-san!

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:12.350
Misumi-san!

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.050
Hello...

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:15.820
Do you have a minute?

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:17.420
What is it?

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.840
I'm Nagisa's friend.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.660
My name is Yui Morioka. I'm a second-year 
student in the Sakura class...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.430
Happy birthday.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.600
This is for you...

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.730
I made this amulet for you, 
praying that you'll get better,

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.990
and won't get hurt, and 
that you'll win the game.

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.400
I put my heart and soul into making it.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.540
Please accept it.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.410
So you were worried about my injury...

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:41.890
Thank you.

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:46.200
Good luck in your last middle school game...

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.950
I'll be there to root for you!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:53.440
Good luck in your last middle school game...

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:55.160
I'll be there to root for you!

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.700
It's the same thing I wrote.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.760
I'll do my best!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.100
Thanks for your support.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:06.700
Misumi-san?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:07.930
Nagisa!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.090
Fujimura-san...

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:18.080
I've... I've always...

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:22.750
I don't know what to say,

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.400
but I have to talk to her.

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:26.220
Nagisa!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.580
What are you doing mepo?

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.260
After you took the time to write it.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.860
Why does it turn out like this?

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:36.730
Why?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:40.600
What's going on anyway?

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:45.160
We're no longer what we were before.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.700
What does he mean?

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.710
What changed?

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.680
Do you people know?

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:52.420
Tell me!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:54.890
Popo!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.120
Honoka! I feel the presence of evil mipo!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:17:59.560
Nagisa!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.760
She's here popo!

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.260
How have I changed?

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.420
What do you want?

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.230
I'm in no mood to deal with you!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.840
Just stay away!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.140
What changed?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.240
Tell me!

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.710
Honoka!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.180
Nagisa!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.040
Did you know, Honoka?

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:28.980
We'll talk later.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.030
We need to transform.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.770
But...

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:31.660
Hurry!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.360
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.050
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.660
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.260
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:12.630
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.070
Go back to where you came from!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.640
I don't know what's going on!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.240
I don't know...!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.480
It's all your fault!

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:27.580
Black!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:30.080
Black isn't her usual self mipo!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:35.020
Black! It's dangerous if 
you don't concentrate mepo!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.520
What is she doing?

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.930
I'll take you on!

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:43.730
You poor thing... Having a partner like her.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:51.540
I'll take care of her!

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:58.980
Popo!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.920
Trying to protect someone 
who's of no use to you.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:07.790
I'm fed up with you.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:12.990
How could you...?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.530
How could you... How could you...

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.000
...do that to White?!

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.660
Your attack is always the same.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:39.910
Pretty Cula!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.000
Accept the power of light popo!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.790
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:20.040
And fight your way toward the future!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.810
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.880
Thanks for coming, White.

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:49.050
You don't have to thank me...

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:51.370
I'm your partner.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.090
It's only natural, isn't it?

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:56.460
Here you go.

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.380
Come on... Let's go home.

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:10.720
It's cold, so pot stew would be 
good for dinner, wouldn't it?

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:16.810
Pot stew will warm you up, 
and calm you down, won't it?

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:20.530
Let's hurry, and go home.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.930
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:42.970
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.370
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:56.270
It's finally here...
Our Christmas party...

00:23:56.270 --> 00:23:58.310
If I confess my love to Fuji P...

00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:01.330
What's wrong with your voice?

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:02.670
I know, but...

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:03.990
I don't have the courage.

00:24:03.990 --> 00:24:05.960
if it snows, it'll be a white Christmas...

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.880
Who would have thought the snowman 
would get that big, and come after us?

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.160
It's Zakenna!

00:24:10.620 --> 00:24:14.570
"I COULDN'T BE HAPPIER?! 
NAGISA'S WHITE CHRISTMAS"

00:24:14.570 --> 00:24:16.100
"Doki wa mune mune suru..."

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:17.810
Don't you mean "mune ga nemu nemu"?

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:19.400
I mean... "Mune ga doki 
doki" (I'm so excited).
